          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<h3>“Tiffany is one of the most inspiring teachers I’ve trained with. She generously offers her knowledge and experience in a way that is so clear and concise, breaking things down so they are easy to digest but then challenging you to apply that information to ensure that you are able to think for yourself.”</h3><p><strong> - Laura G</strong></p>"
